			title: "Reactor-Grade Engineering"
			description: ["Build a Reactor-Grade Frame from NuclearCraft reactor structure, a fission controller, Mekanism fission casing and polonium pellets. The polonium requirement makes this more than a collection of craftable multiblock parts: a functioning late nuclear chain must exist."]
