			id: "2190000000000002"
			title: "Particle Confinement"
			description: ["Build a Particle Confinement Matrix. It consumes Matterworks focusing coils, an actual Ring Accelerator Controller, an AE2 singularity and antimatter pellets. High-energy equipment therefore depends on particle infrastructure and the extreme energy/process chain behind antimatter."]
