			title: "Fusion Field Engineering"
			description: ["Build a Fusion Field Core from Mekanism fusion-reactor control hardware, the Alchemistry Fusion Chamber Controller, antimatter and Nether Stars. This deliberately combines two independent fusion-era systems rather than allowing either mod to complete the endgame alone."]
