			id: "2190000000000004"
			title: "Quantum Singularity Core"
			description: ["Converge reactor engineering, accelerator research, fusion engineering and AE2 singularity technology into the Quantum Singularity Core. This is the prestige component used by equipment whose capability approaches creative-mode convenience."]
