			id: "2190000000000005"
			title: "MekaSuit"
			description: ["Construct the complete MekaSuit only after the prestige component chain exists. Every armour piece consumes multiple multi-program components, so the suit represents completion of the factory rather than the point where one mod happens to become available."]
